## Elements

cultivation-element-Metal = metal
cultivation-element-Wood = wood
cultivation-element-Water = water
cultivation-element-Fire = fire
cultivation-element-Earth = earth
cultivation-combo-resonates = Your {$one} and {$two} qi resonate! A new technique opens to you.

## Universal techniques

cultivation-sense-cultivator = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))}: {$realm}
cultivation-sense-body = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))}: a {$stage} body
cultivation-sense-manual = Something here is steeped in qi.
cultivation-sense-nothing = Your divine sense finds nothing out of the ordinary.
cultivation-empty-palm = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s empty palm sends {THE($target)} flying!
cultivation-void-step-blocked = There is no open ground there to step out onto.
cultivation-realm-pressure = The air around {THE($user)} turns heavy as a mountain!
cultivation-realm-pressure-crushed = A crushing pressure bears down on you!
cultivation-acupoint-sealed = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} jabs a pressure point on {THE($target)}!
cultivation-talisman-needs-paper = You need a sheet of paper in your hand.
cultivation-talisman-needs-law = You need a Root Law to write with.
cultivation-talisman-written = You inscribe a {$element} talisman.
cultivation-talisman-burns = The talisman in {THE($user)}'s hand flares and burns away!
cultivation-transmit-law = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} pours {POSS-ADJ($user)} law into a slip of jade.
cultivation-awakened = Qi stirs in your dantian for the first time. You have awakened as a cultivator!
cultivation-concealment-on = You draw your qi deep inside. To anyone looking, you are a mortal.
cultivation-concealment-off = You let your qi flow freely again.
cultivation-concealment-broken = Using your qi gives you away. You are no longer concealed.
cultivation-forced-circulation-on = You drive your qi past the safe limit. Meditation will be faster, and riskier.
cultivation-forced-circulation-off = You let your qi settle back to a safe pace.
cultivation-forced-circulation-backlash = Your overdriven qi tears at your meridians!
cultivation-forget-nothing = You have no Complementary Law to release.
cultivation-forget-start = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} closes {POSS-ADJ($user)} eyes as a thin stream of qi drifts away.
cultivation-forget-done = {$law} drains out of your meridians. There is room for a new Complementary Law.
cultivation-formation-Gathering = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} inscribes a gathering array on the floor.
cultivation-formation-Barrier = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} raises a ring of shimmering qi walls!
cultivation-formation-Alarm = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} inscribes an alarm array on the floor.
cultivation-alarm-array-tripped = Your alarm array whispers: {THE($intruder)} has stepped inside.
cultivation-soul-departs = A small golden figure steps out of {THE($user)}, whose body slumps still.
cultivation-soul-returns = The golden figure flies back into {THE($user)}.

## Ascension

cultivation-heavenly-omen = Heavenly Omen
cultivation-ascension-begins = The sky above {$user} darkens. A cultivator is attempting to ascend!
cultivation-ascended = The void splits open above {$user}. A cultivator has ascended to the Immortal Realm!
cultivation-ascension-failed = Heaven smashes {THE($user)} down! {CAPITALIZE(POSS-ADJ($user))} core cracks and half {POSS-ADJ($user)} foundation scatters.

## Law techniques

cultivation-artifact-bound = You bind {THE($item)} to your soul.
cultivation-artifact-none = You have no artifact bound to your soul.
cultivation-artifact-too-far = Your artifact is too far away to call back.
cultivation-artifact-recalled = {CAPITALIZE(THE($item))} flies back into your hand.
cultivation-artifact-must-hold = Hold your bound artifact to send it flying.
cultivation-artifact-strike = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} sends {THE($item)} flying at {THE($target)}!
cultivation-sword-riding = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} rises onto a streak of qi and rides it!
cultivation-sword-formation = Spectral swords spring up and circle {THE($user)}!
cultivation-sword-formation-parry = A circling sword bats the shot aside!
cultivation-calm-heart = Stillness flows from {THE($user)} into {THE($target)}.
cultivation-turtle-breathing = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s breathing slows until it stops altogether.
cultivation-mirror-lake = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} goes as still as a mirror lake.
cultivation-kindle = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} snaps {POSS-ADJ($user)} fingers and {THE($target)} catches fire!
cultivation-furnace-burst = A ring of fire bursts out from {THE($user)}!
cultivation-burning-blood = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} burns {POSS-ADJ($user)} own blood essence for power!
cultivation-golden-bell-qi = A bell of golden qi closes around {THE($user)}!
cultivation-dharma-idol = A towering golden Buddha rises behind {THE($user)}!
cultivation-idol-palm = A colossal golden palm slams into {THE($target)}!
cultivation-buddha-palm-shadow = A vast shadow falls from above!
cultivation-verdant-growth = Green qi spreads from {THE($user)} into the plants around {OBJECT($user)}.
cultivation-binding-vines = Vines burst from the floor and wrap around {THE($target)}!

## Combinations

cultivation-steam-veil = A billowing cloud of steam swallows {THE($user)}!
cultivation-molten-step = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))}'s footsteps begin to glow with magma.

## Spirit beasts

cultivation-beast-unfit = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} can't be bound as a spirit beast.
cultivation-beast-contracted = {CAPITALIZE(THE($user))} binds {THE($target)} as a spirit beast!
cultivation-beast-none = You have no living spirit beast.
cultivation-beast-too-far = Your spirit beast is too far away to hear you.
cultivation-beast-summoned = {CAPITALIZE(THE($target))} answers its master's call.
